{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 11: the plant decision under uncertainty. A first phase is built now; a second phase can be added at a decision point, once the first phase has shown what demand, prices and ramp-up really are. Scenario factors scale the margin; the large plant of section 11.6 is the case Phase 1 = 3 million, 10 months, 60,000 a month, and no expansion. }
Construction Cost=
	1.8e+06
	~	dollars
	~	Phase 1 cost, including the site and infrastructure that phase 2 will share.
	|
Construction Time=
	6
	~	month
	~	|
Construction Spending=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time < Construction Time, Construction Cost / Construction Time, 0)
	~	dollars/month
	~	|
Plant Available=
	STEP(1, Construction Time)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Ramp Up Time=
	6
	~	month
	~	Average time to reach full output once a phase is built (scenario factor).
	|
Ramp Up=
	(Plant Available - Utilisation) / Ramp Up Time
	~	1/month
	~	|
Utilisation= INTEG(
	Ramp Up,
	0)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Full Margin=
	35000
	~	dollars/month
	~	Phase 1 margin at full output, at planned demand and price.
	|
Demand Factor=
	1
	~	dmnl
	~	Realised demand relative to plan (scenario factor).
	|
Price Factor=
	1
	~	dmnl
	~	Realised margin per unit relative to plan (scenario factor).
	|
Margin Factor=
	Demand Factor * Price Factor
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Expand=
	0
	~	dmnl
	~	1 if phase 2 is built at the decision point; set by the decision rule, from what phase 1 has shown by then.
	|
Decision Time=
	30
	~	month
	~	|
Expansion Cost=
	1.2e+06
	~	dollars
	~	|
Expansion Build Time=
	5
	~	month
	~	|
Expansion Spending=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time >= Decision Time :AND: Time < Decision Time + Expansion Build Time, Expand * Expansion Cost / Expansion Build Time, 0)
	~	dollars/month
	~	|
Expansion Available=
	Expand * STEP(1, Decision Time + Expansion Build Time)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Expansion Ramp Up=
	(Expansion Available - Expansion Utilisation) / Ramp Up Time
	~	1/month
	~	|
Expansion Utilisation= INTEG(
	Expansion Ramp Up,
	0)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Expansion Full Margin=
	25000
	~	dollars/month
	~	Phase 2 margin at full output, at planned demand and price.
	|
Margin=
	Margin Factor * (Full Margin * Utilisation + Expansion Full Margin * Expansion Utilisation)
	~	dollars/month
	~	|
Cash Flow=
	Margin - Construction Spending - Expansion Spending
	~	dollars/month
	~	|
Cumulative Cash= INTEG(
	Cash Flow,
	0)
	~	dollars
	~	|
Discount Rate=
	0.01
	~	1/month
	~	|
Discount Factor=
	EXP(-Discount Rate * Time)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Discounted Cash Flow=
	Cash Flow * Discount Factor
	~	dollars/month
	~	|
Present Value= INTEG(
	Discounted Cash Flow,
	0)
	~	dollars
	~	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ month ~ |
FINAL TIME = 120 ~ month ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
